#.gitignore
# Files and folders listed here will be IGNORED by Git.
# They will NOT be uploaded to GitHub.

.env                 # Your secret keys and passwords
__pycache__/         # Python's auto-generated bytecode files (not needed)
*.pyc                # Compiled Python files (not needed)
*.pyo                # Optimized Python files (not needed)
venv/                # Virtual environment folder (too large to upload)
env/                 # Another common virtual environment folder name